        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Elvis Presley\n- Products: Elvis Country (I'm 10,000 Years Old), \"It Hurts Me\"\n- Companies: RCA Records, RCA Victor\n- Concepts: cultural icons, \"King of Rock and Roll\"\n\nFacts:\n- Elvis Presley recorded the Top 40 song \"It Hurts Me\" on RCA Victor in 1964.\n- Elvis Country (I'm 10,000 Years Old) is the eleventh studio album by American singer and musician Elvis Presley, and RCA Records released it as LSP 4460 in January 1971.\n- Elvis Presley is regarded as one of the most significant cultural icons of the 20th century.\n- Elvis Presley is often referred to as the \"King of Rock and Roll\" or simply \"the King\".",
